  "description": "Production .NET APIs for importing verified MiniModel peer pieces, downloading pinned Hugging Face source revisions, converting supported safetensors models locally, and serving user-approved .slm peer pieces. Bundled Rust executables remain authoritative for manifests, hashes, conversion receipts, model validation, composition graphs, and model assembly. The package includes no model weights, training system, hosted model bytes, or project-server model proxy.",
